<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">57 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Paulo kuli Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tito</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya Paulo kuli Tito</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tito</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya Tito ni limo lya makalata ana kufuma kuli Paulo alikutumwa kubantu mumusena wakutumwa ku mubungano. Makalata naambi atatu ni 1 Timoti, 2 Timoti ne Filimoni. Paulo walalembela Tito, nsombi walalemba eti kalata yela kubelengwa mwakolobesha. Tucishici, pakwinga lambanga sha kwelelwa kwakendi kwa kuba mutumwa, cintu Tito ncalikuba weshiba kendi. Paulo walalemba iyi kalata pakati pa 63-65 A.D.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo walikuba lamulaya kendi Tito, kutangunina mibungano yalikuba pansumbu ya Kelete. Paulo walalemba kalata kwambeti alailile Tito sha kusala ne kwiyisha batangunishi ba mubungano. Kayi walapa malailile alico mu makalata akendi kuli Timoti. Kalata yakendi ilambanga cena batangunishi mobelela kubela ne cendo caina, kuba citondesho. Mibungano ne batangunishi ba lelo belela kushako mano kukuba ne mikalilo ilayandikinga mubutangunishi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lambilinga Tito kubika bantu bakute mikalilo ya bulesa 11-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lamwambilinga sha kwiyisha bantu kuba ne cendo caina 2:1 mpaka 3:11.</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakupwililisha lapwishinga ne kulemba maswi akupwililisha 3:12-15</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame paulo musebenshi wa Lesa, mutumwa wa Klistu Yesu, walantuma ku bantu balasalwa ne Lesa, kwambeti ndibatangunine kulushomo lwakwinshiba cancinencine cela kubatwala kubuyumi bwakulemekesha Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nekubapa kupembelela buyumi butapu. ubo Lesa utabepe,mbwalashomesha kumyaka ya ndoba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino pacindi celela walayubulula kushomesha uko mumakani akendi. Makani ayo walabika mumakasa akame, weco ndamukambaukili kwelana ne Lesa mupulushi wetu ncalang'ambila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndakulembelenga Tito, mwaname wancine ncine mulushomo lwetu twense.</para>
  <para style="p">Neco Mwami Lesa ne Klistu Yesu, bamupeni lumuno ne luse.</para>
  <para style="s">Ncito ya Tito ku Kelete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi ndalakushiya ku Kelete kwambeti ubambulule bintu byalashala nekubika batangunishi ba mibungano mu minshi yonse mbuli ncondalakwambila. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mutangunishi wa mubungano welela kuba muntu wa mpuwo yaina, kayi abe weba mukashi umo, ne bana bakendi bashoma Klistu, kayi beshikunyumfwila bamashali ne kutensa byaipa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muntu weshikulangilila mubungano welela kuba ne mpuwo yaina mbulyeti mwembeshi wabikwa ne Lesa. Nkelela kuba muntu shikukolwa bwalwa nambi wabukalu nambi shikuma banendi kayi wabula kushomeka mumakwebo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Welela kuba shikutambula cena bensu, weshikusuna byaina ne kulikata cali kayi walulama shikulikanisha kwinsa byaipa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi welela kwikatishisha Maswi ashomeka mbuli ncaleishiwa, kwambeti acikonshe kuyuminisha nabambi ne lwiyisho lwancine ncine kayi ne kucikonsha kukanisha kwinsa byaipa abo bonse bakute kutoteka ciyisho ici.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga pali bantu bangi bakute kwambowa bintu byabuluya byela kutaya banabo. Makamaka bantu balafuma palikoto lya bantu balafuma mu Ciyuda beshikunyonganya nekubepa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Caina kubamweneka, pakwinga baleishinga mikowa ya bantu, bintu mbyobelela kubula kubeisha, nabo balayandangowa mali. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Naumbi wa ku Kelete umo wabashinshimi wabo, walambeti, “Bantu baku Kelete ni ba bepeshi kayi ni bilongolo byaipa, nibatolo, nsombi basuni kulyowa,” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pacebo ici ubakalalile cangofu kwambeti balulame mulushomo, <verse number="14" style="v"/>bacileke kukutika tulabi bwa Bayuda, ne milawo yeshikubikwa ne bantu beshikukana cancinencine. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bintu byonse byaswepa kubantu bakute miyeyo yaswepa, nsombi nkabyaswepa kuli bantu babula luushomo, pakwinga myoyo yabo yaipa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bakute kwambeti Lesa bamwinshi, nsombi minshilo yabo ikute kukana mbyobakute kwamba. Bakute kufundausha kumoyo kayi nkabanyumfwili Lesa, neco nkabelela cintu ciliconse caina.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lwiyisho lwancine ncine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nsombi obe wiyishenga byekatana ne ciyisho ca ncine ncine. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco ubambile batuloba bamakulene kwambeti beshikulikanisha, babe beshikwinsa byacikulene, bamanjeyaulwa alulama, bayuma mulushomo, kayi balusuno, kayi batabwelele panyuma. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kayi naboyo batukashi bensenga byeshikukondwelesha Lesa, belela kuba babombelela mubwikalo bwabo, babula mpyata, nambi basha ba byakunwa bikola. Neco belela kwiyisha bintu byaina, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino bayishenga batukashi batwanike kuba ne lusuno kuli ba maibabo ne bana, <verse number="5" style="v"/>babe beshikulikanisha, beshikusebensa cena pang'anda, kayi bankumbo, balicepesha ku baibabo kwambeti Maswi a Lesa katepishiwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Copeleco ambilako batuloba bamisepela kuba beshikulikanisha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino munshila iliyonse welela kuba muntu wabula kampenda ne kwinsa milimo yaina, kayi welela kwiyisha cabulemu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Cindi conse sebenseshani maswi ayina abula kampenda, kwambeti abo balamulwananga banyumfwe nsoni, kayi babule kucikonsha kwamba maswi ayipa palinjafwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Basha belela kunyumfwila baleli babo ne kubakondwelesha mubintu byonse, kayi nkabelela kupikishanya nabo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nambi kubebila bintu. Nsombi belela kubonesha kwina moyo kwakendi pakwiyisha maswi a Lesa Mupulushi wetu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa walayubulula luse lwakendi kwambeti bantu bonse bapulushiwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Luse ulu lulatwiyishinga kwambeti twelela kucileka kwikala mubuyumi bwaipa ne lunkumbwa lwa bintu bya pacishi capanshi kwambeti twikale mu buyumi bwa bu Lesa masuba onse, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ntepasa tulapembelela bushiku bwa colwe akabonekela Mupulushi wetu Yesu Klistu, ne bulemu bunene bwa Lesa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nendi walalibenga kutufuna kubwipishi bonse nekutuswepesha kwambeti tube bantu bakendi balibambila kwinsa bintu byaina. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ibi embyowela kubeyisha, wela kubayuminisha, kayi ne kukansa cangofu abo balakutikinga. Kakutaba muntu nambi umo shikukunyansha.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Libambileni kwinsa mulimo waina uli wonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ubanushe bantu kwambeti babenga babombelela kubatangunishi ne bendeleshi babo ne kubanyumfwila kayi nekulibambila kwinsa mulimo waina, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kayi batambanga byaipa pa banabo nambi kuyambana, nsombi kuba babombelela ne kulesha bulemu kumuntu uliyense. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga nenjafwe tobene twalikuba baluya, batanyumfwili kayi balubila.Twalikuba basha balunkumbwa lwa mubili kayi ne byakulikondwelesha byapusana pusana. Twalikwikala mubuyumi bwa miyeyo yakupatana ne munyono. Bantu balikuba batupata kayi nenjafwe twalikuba twabapata. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nsombi inkumbo ne kuyanda kwa Lesa Mupulushi wetu mpobyalayubululwa, <verse number="5" style="v"/>walatupulusha. Nkalenseco pacebo cakwambeti twalensa bintu byaina, nsombi pacebo ca inkumbo shakendi. Walatupulusha kupitila mukusukiwa kwa kusemwa lino kayi ne buyumi bwa lino lino mungofu sha Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lesa walatupa Mushimu Uswepa camakasa abili kupitila muli Yesu Klistu Mupulushi wetu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Walenseco kwambeti munkumbo shakendi tululamikwe pamenso a Lesa ne kwingila mubuyumi butapu ubo mbotulapembelelenga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Makani awa nakubinga. Ndayandanga kwambeti makani awa wakambauke cangofu kwambeti bashome muli Lesa ne kulibenga kwinsa milimo yaina, iyo yeshikukondwelesha ne kunyamfwa bantu bonse. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco obe fumamo mubuyumi bwa kupikishana kwabuluya, kuyanda kulangaula mikondo ya mikowa, nekwambana, kayi ne kupikishanya pa bintu bya Milawo, pakwinga ibi nkabikute kunyamfwa kayi kuliya mobibelele. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muntu weshikuleta lupatuko pakati penu umucenjeshe mankanda abili, kufuma apo umusule. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ucinshi muntu wamushoboyu ni wazelezeka kayi kuzelezeka kwakendi kulalesheti walubila.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndakatumunga Atema ne Tukiko kuli njobe, ukeleshe cangofu kwisa kuli njame ku Nikopoli, pakwinga enkondayeyenga akwikala mucindi ca mupewo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Weleshe cangofu kunyamfwa Zena shimilawo, ne Apolo, pabulwendo bwabo, nekuboneti bintu byonse byayandika kuli endibo bilakwana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bantu betu belela kwiya kulibenga kwinsa bintu byaina, kwambeti banyamfwilishe mubintu bilayandikinga, kutambeti bekalenga mubuyumi bwabula pindu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bonse mbotuli nabo balamupanga mitende. Utupeleko mitende banetu bashoma, luse lwa Lesa lube nenjamwe mwense.</para>
</usx>
